title: "Watt Forge: converter design from first principles"
abstract: "Open-source power-electronics converter design platform: first-principles lessons, live loss models, an MPPT and efficiency-control library benchmarked on EN 50530-style tests, and a hybrid three-level GaN buck-boost reference design for solar."
